This product includes work derived from three upstream projects, all MIT
licensed. Each skill below records the upstream commit it was adapted from, so
the derivation can be audited and re-synced later.

Arc's skills are adaptations, not copies: prompts were rewritten, upstream-
internal machinery (agent types, state paths, hook keywords) was removed, and
behavior was retargeted at Arc's own conventions. Where a file is original to
Arc, it is labeled as such below rather than credited to an upstream.


