3. Understand-Anything — https://github.com/Egonex-AI/Understand-Anything
   Commit 32944829e7a63a9fa9c55d811d7f98a9530c6a6a (v2.9.4)
================================================================================

Partially adapted into Arc's skills/scan/SKILL.md:

  mode `explain`    section structure adapted from
                    understand-anything-plugin/skills/understand-explain/SKILL.md
  mode `onboard`    section structure adapted from
                    understand-anything-plugin/skills/understand-onboard/SKILL.md

In both cases the upstream skills are readers of a knowledge-graph.json that
Arc does not produce, so their graph-reading instructions were removed and the
data contract was retargeted at the repository itself.

NOT derived from Understand-Anything:

  mode `map`        original to Arc. Understand-Anything's `understand` skill is
                    an eight-phase pipeline over ~250 KB of .mjs/.py helpers plus
                    language and framework reference files; none of it is used
                    here, and `map` produces a markdown map, not a knowledge
                    graph.
  mode `dashboard`  contains no Understand-Anything code. It detects whether the
                    Understand-Anything plugin is installed and directs the user
                    to run it directly.

